  "readings": [
    {
      "hash": "#chapter-2",
      "images": 49,
      "broken": [],
      "overflow": false,
      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N2-02",
          "text": "Sweet?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-02",
          "text": "Yes. Please.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-03",
          "text": "Would you help me get these received?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-03",
          "text": "Show me the receipt.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-04",
          "text": "A reply to Lower District?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-05",
          "text": "I cannot register a return against a closed route. There is no inspected entrance on file.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-06",
          "text": "I was paid there this morning. That signature belongs to a person.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-07",
          "text": "The payment stands. For an office return, I need a current door register and an inspected route.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-08",
          "text": "I filed these. This time I will walk it, with the residents.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-09",
          "text": "Bring it back before this desk closes. I will keep the case open.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-10",
          "text": "Names first. Then the doors they actually use.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-11",
          "text": "Hessa moved down one landing.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-11",
          "text": "Then that is where the post goes.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-12",
          "text": "I will keep this latch clear. Start here. Come back here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-13",
          "text": "This inspection is work. You will be paid for the round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-14",
          "text": "All right. Stairs first.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-15",
          "text": "You will not have to jump the railing again.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-17",
          "text": "She thinks I stopped answering.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-18",
          "text": "I can take your answer.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-19",
          "text": "This is the door you collect from?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-19",
          "text": "Every working day.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-20",
          "text": "Down here. The sign never moved with me.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-21",
          "text": "I will record both: the old sign and this entrance.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-22",
          "text": "You missed breakfast.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-22",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-23",
          "text": "Keep it quiet. I have only just got them to sleep.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-24",
          "text": "I will.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-25",
          "text": "These doors. These names. I can stand behind that.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-26",
          "text": "SeraThis span cannot go on a public return route.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-27",
          "text": "Then we take the long stair.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-28",
          "text": "Set it down. We have time for one breath.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-29",
          "text": "One strap doing two shoulders\u2019 work.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-31",
          "text": "Inspected entrance. Occupied doors. The broken span is excluded.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-32",
          "text": "They are still in the old book. The route was closed; the names were never removed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-33",
          "text": "I can receive the petition now. Replies can travel by the inspected stair.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-34",
          "text": "Received. Manual return route registered.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-35",
          "text": "Something I can bring back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-35",
          "text": "MaretAnd somewhere we can send an answer.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-36",
          "text": "Registered carriage includes a load kit. It belongs to your route.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-38",
          "text": "Shoulders and hips share the bag. Your line still pulls only you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-39",
          "text": "Next trip. I want this one delivered whole.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-40",
          "text": "Receiving deck. Use the fixed post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-43",
          "text": "All seals dry.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-44",
          "text": "Thank you for writing the return address in full.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-45",
          "text": "They have written us a return address. In their own book.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-46",
          "text": "The morning round is paid work, if you want it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-46",
          "text": "I want it.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-47",
          "text": "Ask me about the rent after your first week.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-47",
          "text": "I will.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-48",
          "text": "That beacon was marked dark when they closed the circuit.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-48",
          "text": "Then we start by finding its supply.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N2-49",
          "text": "ArenAfter the morning post. They know where to send the answer now.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
